cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use EncFormer, please cite the paper below."
title: "EncFormer: Secure and Efficient Transformer Inference over Encrypted Data"
abstract: >-
  EncFormer is a hybrid FHE + MPC system for private Transformer inference:
  linear layers run under GPU CKKS homomorphic encryption (PhantomFHE) and
  the non-linear layers run as two-party MPC protocols (EzPC/SCI) —
  Π_MBMax (Batch Power-Max softmax), Π_MBLN (Batch LayerNorm), and Π_GELU
  (BOLT piecewise GELU).
